Single site auditTenant-wide top 10 discoveryPipeline to recycle bin cleanup <pre><code>Get-SPCStorageWaste -SiteUrl 'https://contoso.sharepoint.com/sites/Marketing' -IncludeVersions -IncludePreservationHold
</code></pre> <pre><code>Get-SPCStorageWaste -Top 10 -IncludeVersions | Export-SPCStorageReport -Format HTML -OutputPath '.\Reports'
</code></pre> <pre><code>Get-SPCStorageWaste -IncludeRecycleBin | Where-Object TotalWasteMB -gt 51200 | ForEach-Object {
    Clear-SPCRecycleBin -SiteUrl $_.SiteUrl -OlderThanDays 30 -DryRun
}
</code></pre>
